        <Asset>
            <Template>AudioText</Template>
            <Values>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Murad Bey of the Coast arrives within the month, and you, Governor, do not even know where to seat a guest! Sit down. We have work to do.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>40970</LineID>
                </Text>
                <AudioText>
                    <AudioAsset>1404000466</AudioAsset>
                </AudioText>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001276</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_QuestStart</Name>
                </Standard>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>AudioText</Template>
            <Values>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Correct! The seat of honour, far from the door and the draught. Perhaps you are not entirely hopeless after all.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>40971</LineID>
                </Text>
                <AudioText>
                    <AudioAsset>1404000522</AudioAsset>
                    <Mood>Positve</Mood>
                </AudioText>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001277</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_RightChoice</Name>
                </Standard>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>AudioText</Template>
            <Values>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Wrong! Do you want Murad Bey to tell the entire Diwan that Wadi Al Zahir is governed by barbarians?</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>40972</LineID>
                </Text>
                <AudioText>
                    <AudioAsset>1404000490</AudioAsset>
                    <Mood>Negative</Mood>
                </AudioText>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001278</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_WrongChoice</Name>
                </Standard>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>AudioText</Template>
            <Values>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>A simple question. The Bey enters your reception hall. Where do you seat him?</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>40973</LineID>
                </Text>
                <AudioText>
                    <AudioAsset>1404000470</AudioAsset>
                </AudioText>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001279</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_QuestStart2</Name>
                </Standard>
            </Values>
        </Asset>

        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001280</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Decision_Invitation_Story</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>&lt;b&gt;For thirty years, Nureddin Efendi arranged the Sultan's audiences,&lt;/b&gt; deciding who bowed when, who sat where and who was kept waiting. Now Murad Bey, an influential member of the Diwan in the capital, has announced a visit to Wadi Al Zahir, and the old master of ceremonies is horrified to learn that the governor has never received a guest of rank.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>44188</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001647</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_QuestStartSummary</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Envoy Nureddin Efendi doubts that you know the first thing about court protocol.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>48068</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001648</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_RightChoiceSummary</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Nureddin Efendi grudgingly admits that you know how to honour a guest.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>48070</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001283</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Invitation_WrongChoiceSummary</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Nureddin Efendi throws up his hands in despair at your ignorance of protocol.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>48071</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001284</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Decision_Invitation_DecisionText</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Nureddin Efendi: In the capital, a guest's seat says more than a hundred compliments. Seat a Bey poorly and the whole Diwan will hear of it before his coffee is cold. So tell me: &lt;b&gt;when Murad Bey enters your hall, where will you seat him?&lt;/b&gt;</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>44190</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001649</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Decision_Invitation_Decision1</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>Right by the door, so that he may leave whenever he pleases.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>44191</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
            <Values>
                <Standard>
                    <GUID>1404001286</GUID>
                    <Name>RQ_Envoy_Decision_Invitation_Decision2</Name>
                </Standard>
                <Text>
                    <LocaText>
                        <English>
                            <Text>At my right hand at the head of the table, as is done at Western banquets.</Text>
                            <Status>Exported</Status>
                        </English>
                    </LocaText>
                    <LineID>44192</LineID>
                </Text>
            </Values>
        </Asset>
        <Asset>
            <Template>Text</Template>
